      "parameters": {
        "content": "## W4 · pod-nudge\nEvery day at 18:00 (or POST /webhook/pod-nudge) it checks each pod's progress and, when a pod hasn't merged anything for 3 days, posts one kind nudge in #pods naming the next issue and its reviewer. No direct messages, ever.\n\n**Credentials:** Discord webhook for #pods. Edit **Config** (app URL, user ids).",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "94e1de48-b1a9-5d10-81e9-3f7c2a50a751",
      "name": "Setup notes",
